No?


00:07:36.112 --> 00:07:36.947
Cheers.


00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:37.848
Yeah.


00:07:40.117 --> 00:07:41.819
Is your AC still out?


00:07:41.851 --> 00:07:42.752
