00:14:11.408 --> 00:14:12.308
Cooperate leasing.


00:14:12.341 --> 00:14:13.276
Mm-hmm.


00:14:15.511 --> 00:14:17.647
Sorry, it's not very sexy.


00:14:19.448 --> 00:14:20.483
You're always sexy.


00:14:25.154 --> 00:14:26.355
Oh,


00:14:26.389 --> 00:14:27.724
I remembered, I have
